      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a documentary about the mau mau uprising in kenya. can you give me a timeline of the main events but pls focus heavily on the perspective of the kikuyu fighters and the marginalized groups resisting the british colonial rule?",
      "source": "evaluator"
